s/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQQ18tU3c5V1pmSDRNQTBzX195eVdGcVdSMWpYZXpnR1VyNHdSNW8wbWpPaVJHZEgtZzlEMF80ajJYMVhQTlJxaVRZNWNRM21qWkt5NUdqTHFnVVRQaFJOSEloaGF5MXM5Vm9VWGpWeUpUSWJleGhyQjhjUi1HWk02ejlLd2F5TW8xNGc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"Rigetti Computer 2026 年第三季獲利結果值得期待"},{"title":"8 Best Quantum Computing Stocks in 2026 | Investing","src":"U.S. News Money","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNX1hyeGtlakpTeHowbE14UGYtTHVyWHZjVXNWTWVjOTFsS093NURWM1JKeUw3SE1aS2I2aVhoMGZJMG1sNDZWLUgwNFRGR2RhZEFfMi1wRUx0TUJqeEJnSWxhai0tNzRBbXZwejh4clhlb3J2MGR0V2xnZnRaS3JTNUg3UjBCVUU?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"2026 年 8 隻最佳量子計算股票 |投資"},{"title":"IonQ Jumped 7%, Rigetti Up 8% on Intel’s $2.3 Billion Quantum Buy: “Full-Stack Quantum Computing Business”","src":"TIKR.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPbW9qelRVVTVibmctdDBxeE5xRkxLeWUycEFydDFTTzlrS2hvVl9aRnNQdEJtUmtMa2xvQ2h5WjM5aTJ5NWx0NjNycnh0ZmhuRjJRVDFQOUVDd0tzNnlrQkstZUREeGh0VlR3b1FURm1Kd2wzTkI4WUdINHh0RWVtYVUyeHZJVXB3U2tDaWZ5N3BPR2IwMW9NcnRueFhMSzR0akNaX2R2ZkxTLUlaWk9LTEJlMFJGY0Q2U3B4YXNJR1hZQQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-27","zh":"英特爾斥資 23 億美元收購“全端量子計算業務”，IonQ 上漲 7%，Rigetti 上漲 8%"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":4},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-04","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1838359/000110465926023454/rgti-20251231x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Our mission is to build the world's most powerful computers to help solve humanity's most important and pressing problems. Our strategy is to be at the forefront of superconducting quantum computing.","zh":"我們的使命是打造世界上最強大的計算機，幫助解決人類最重要、最迫切的問題。我們的策略是處於超導量子運算的最前線。"},{"en":"Classical computers are plateauing, Moore's law has slowed, returns for parallelization are diminishing and energy requirements can't keep up. Today, many of the world's most important computational challenges remain intractable, lying beyond the capabilities of traditional supercomputers and cloud infrastructure. We build and operate quantum computers. We believe quantum computing represents one of the most transformative emerging capabilities in the world today. By leveraging quantum mechanics, our quantum computers process information in fundamentally new, more powerful ways compared to classical computing with meaningful power efficiency. When scaled, we believe these systems are poised to solve problems of staggering computational complexity at unprecedented speed.","zh":"經典電腦正趨於穩定，摩爾定律已經放緩，並行化的回報正在遞減，能源需求也跟不上。如今，世界上許多最重要的運算挑戰仍然難以解決，超出了傳統超級電腦和雲端基礎設施的能力範圍。我們建造並經營量子計算機。我們相信量子運算代表了當今世界最具變革性的新興能力之一。透過利用量子力學，我們的量子計算機以全新的、比經典計算更強大的方式處理訊息，並具有有意義的功效。當規模擴大時，我們相信這些系統能夠以前所未有的速度解決計算複雜性驚人的問題。"},{"en":"The availability of scalable quantum computers is expected to enable scientists and engineers to address problems in areas like climate change, fusion energy, quantitative finance, drug development and discovery, materials science, and artificial intelligence (\"AI\"). Our quantum computers are based on superconducting qubits, which we believe is the leading quantum computing modality based on their fast gate speeds and defined pathway to scaling. Our quantum computers currently achieve gate speeds of 50-70 nanoseconds, which is about 1,000 times faster than other modalities such as trapped ions or pure atoms based on publicly available information. We have developed the world's first multi-chip quantum processor for scalable quantum computing systems. We expect this patented and patent pending modular chip architecture to be the building block for new generations of quantum processors tha","zh":"可擴展量子電腦的出現預計將使科學家和工程師能夠解決氣候變遷、聚變能源、定量金融、藥物開發和發現、材料科學和人工智慧（「AI」）等領域的問題。我們的量子電腦基於超導量子位元，我們相信超導量子位元是領先的量子計算模式，基於其快速的閘速度和定義的擴展路徑。根據公開訊息，我們的量子計算機目前可實現 50-70 奈秒的閘速度，比捕獲離子或純原子等其他模式快約 1,000 倍。我們開發了世界上第一個用於可擴展量子運算系統的多晶片量子處理器。我們預計這種已獲得專利和正在申請專利的模組化晶片架構將成為新一代量子處理器的建構模組"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The quantum computing market is evolving and highly competitive. With the introduction of new innovations and the potential entry of new competitors into the market, we expect competition to increase in the future, which could harm our business, results of operations, or financial condition.","zh":"量子運算市場正在不斷發展且競爭激烈。隨著新創新的引入以及新競爭對手可能進入市場，我們預計未來競爭將會加劇，這可能會損害我們的業務、營運績效或財務狀況。"},{"en":"Our current and prospective competitors include companies engaged in the research, development, and operation of quantum computing capabilities. Major companies now developing both quantum hardware and software include IBM, Google, Microsoft, IonQ, D-Wave, Quantinuum and PsiQuantum, among others. In addition, because of the importance of quantum computing, most large public cloud providers and traditional chip makers are researching and investing in quantum computing initiatives, in some cases seeking to build quantum computers. For example, Amazon is engaged in the research and development of quantum computers. A number of development-stage companies are also seeking to build quantum computers, quantum software and applications, and quantum cloud computing services.","zh":"我們目前和潛在的競爭對手包括從事量子運算能力研究、開發和營運的公司。目前開發量子硬體和軟體的主要公司包括 IBM、Google、微軟、IonQ、D-Wave、Quantinuum 和 PsiQuantum 等。此外，由於量子運算的重要性，大多數大型公有雲供應商和傳統晶片製造商都在研究和投資量子運算計劃，在某些情況下尋求建構量子電腦。例如，亞馬遜就從事量子計算機的研發。許多處於發展階段的公司也在尋求建構量子電腦、量子軟體和應用程式以及量子雲端運算服務。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Collaborative Research & Other Professional Services","val":6676000,"zh":"合作研究及其他專業服務"},{"name":"Access To Quantum Computing Systems","val":412000,"zh":"存取量子計算系統"}],"total":7088000}},"peers":["QBTS","IONQ","QUBT","SOUN","OKLO"]}}